\section{Motivation}

Xonix is one of the well-known classic games. It was released in 1984.
Its graphics are not fancy, but the gameplay is very fun and competitive.

I really enjoyed playing Xonix. Because of this, I wanted to make a modern 3D version of the game. My goal was to keep the main gameplay idea of Xonix and present it in a 3D environment.

