\section{Performance Evaluation}

To measure the game performance, I used grid size and ball count as
parameters. The Y-axis shows the average FPS.

Since I do not expect to use more than 100 balls in the levels, the
performance seems good enough. For this range, the FPS is higher than 200.

Also, from this graph, I understood that grid size does not affect FPS much. However, the ball count has a big effect on FPS.

